WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Reach for the orange pot

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.800
Grasp the orange pot

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.800
Lift the orange pot

4
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.200
Move the orange pot to the bottom side of the knife and bottom right of the table

5
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.000
Place the orange pot on the table

6
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Release the orange pot
